#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""timesheet-provider <post|patch|lookup|list|refresh> [arguments]

The provider contract's one command (docs/provider-contract.md). It is a path today
(`python "<daily>/scripts/provider/bin/timesheet-provider" ...`) and a bare command name
after a plugin split; nothing about its arguments, output or exit codes changes then.
"""
